OL,3,GNEWSALate singer 'always there', says
OL,4,AThe Wanted bandmate
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith four million singles and a million
OL,7,Falbum sales under their belts, The
OL,8,FWanted were one of the biggest boy
OL,9,Fbands in the 2010s.
OL,11,FAfter breaking through onto the music
OL,12,Fscene in America, the band enjoyed
OL,13,Fglobal success before tragedy struck
OL,14,Fwhen Bolton-born Tom Parker died from a
OL,15,Fbrain tumour in 2022 at the age of 33.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
