OL,3,GNEWSALate singer 'always there', says
OL,4,AThe Wanted bandmate
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs band members Max George and Siva
OL,7,FKaneswaran set off on tour as The
OL,8,FWanted 2.0, George, from Swinton, in
OL,9,FManchester, spoke to BBC North West
OL,10,FTonight about Parker, returning to the
OL,11,Fstage as a two-piece, and going through
OL,12,Fheart surgery.
OL,14,FHe spoke ahead of The Wanted 2.0
OL,15,Fperforming at Manchester Academy on
OL,16,FFriday.
